Pages: 2025.10.16.682769
Section: New Results},
	file = {Full Text PDF:/home/enguang/Zotero/storage/Z3CH2T7U/Cleij et al. - 2025 - Assembly and cell-free expression of a partial genome for the synthetic cell.pdf:application/pdf},
